# The Noun Project

> Noun Project is the world's most extensive and diverse icon library, with more than 8 million free icons and a growing collection of free stock photos. Noun Project's mission is to build a global visual language that unites us, transcending linguistic and cultural boundaries. Since 2010, users have turned to Noun Project's vast collection of vector icons and style-matched icon packs to boost visual communication in their presentations, websites, user interfaces, design systems, logos, and more. Designers, businesses, educators, and other professionals prefer Noun Project because it offers expertly crafted, professionally curated, clearly licensed, and thoughtfully diverse SVG and PNG images to download.

Noun Project's Differentiators

- Incredible depth and breadth of the icon library
- Exceptional and consistent icon and photo art quality
- Intentional content diversity and inclusivity
- Excellent tools to find and use stylistically matching icons
- Human-first approach to the collection's images, artist contributors, and user community
- All icons in the collection are designed by human artists, not AI
- Noun Project showcases and fairly compensates an international community of artists

Noun Project's Core Benefits

- All icons are free - simply provide attribution to the artist
- Vast icon library - millions of vector icons and PNGs
- Large selection of themed icon sets in styles designed by artists
- Most respected, diverse, and extensive icon collection in the world
- 100% human-created and human-moderated icons and photos
- Consistent, professional-quality icons and photos that are preferred by designers, artists, and businesses
- All icons and photos have easy-to-understand, worry-free licenses. They are safe to use for personal and commercial projects.
- Pro plans available for purchase provide more tools and benefits, and directly support artists

Noun Project's Key Features

- Multiple file formats: Every icon is available as a PNG and as an editable SVG. All photos are high-resolution JPGs.
- AI-enhanced search and style matching: Effortlessly find visually matching icons in thousands of styles
- Icon Libraries for PowerPoint, Illustrator, Figma, and more: Download our Adobe, Office, or Google plugin or our Mac App to drag and drop icons into presentations and designs without leaving your workflow.
- Easy icon editor: Re-color, rotate and change background color with a click
- Icon API: Developers can integrate their apps and websites with the entire icon library via Noun Project's REST API. Secured with OAuth and built on AWS, the Noun Project icon API includes millions of PNG and SVG icons, advanced search tools, AI image style matching, simple re-coloring, rich metadata, and more.

